-## Making a record tax-ready
+## Split mixed costs
 
-To give a movement tax meaning, you turn it into a sorted, categorized record. A tax-ready record carries three things:
+Deduct only the business share of a cost that serves both business and private life. Choose one of three ways to get that split:
 
